From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "D.R.racer" <drracer@seznam.cz>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 06:32:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] clk: sunxi-ng: a10: export pll-ddr-other and pin the MP
 clock parent

The A20 mixer processor (2D engine) has to run from pll-ddr-other, like
the legacy 3.4 driver did. Its module clock "de-mp" can also be muxed
to the two video PLLs, but their rates follow the display modes, which
would change the engine clock with every mode set.

Export pll-ddr-other so that the device tree can select it through
assigned-clock-parents, and set CLK_SET_RATE_NO_REPARENT on de-mp: the
sunxi-ng mux helper otherwise considers every parent on a rate request,
and a video PLL that happens to give the same or a closer rate would
silently take over. de-mp has no other user, and it still never changes
the rate of its parent.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun4i-a10.c      | 9 +++++++--
 drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun4i-a10.h      | 2 +-
 include/dt-bindings/clock/sun4i-a10-ccu.h | 1 +
 3 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun4i-a10.c b/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun4i-a10.c
index 409feb085..de44e7ce5 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun4i-a10.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun4i-a10.c
@@ -697,9 +697,14 @@ static SUNXI_CCU_M_WITH_MUX_GATE(de_fe0_clk, "de-fe0", de_parents,
 static SUNXI_CCU_M_WITH_MUX_GATE(de_fe1_clk, "de-fe1", de_parents,
 				 0x110, 0, 4, 24, 2, BIT(31), 0);
 
-/* Undocumented on A10 */
+/*
+ * Undocumented on A10. The 2D engine is unrelated to the display, so keep
+ * it off the video PLLs, whose rates follow the display modes: the parent
+ * is set once (from the DT) and a rate change only adjusts the divider.
+ */
 static SUNXI_CCU_M_WITH_MUX_GATE(de_mp_clk, "de-mp", de_parents,
-				 0x114, 0, 4, 24, 2, BIT(31), 0);
+				 0x114, 0, 4, 24, 2, BIT(31),
+				 CLK_SET_RATE_NO_REPARENT);
 
 static const char *const disp_parents[] = { "pll-video0", "pll-video1",
 					    "pll-video0-2x", "pll-video1-2x" };
diff --git a/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun4i-a10.h b/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun4i-a10.h
index 271b96236..5cd16717f 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun4i-a10.h
+++ b/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun4i-a10.h
@@ -24,7 +24,7 @@
 #define CLK_PLL_VE		10
 #define CLK_PLL_DDR_BASE	11
 #define CLK_PLL_DDR		12
-#define CLK_PLL_DDR_OTHER	13
+/* The PLL_DDR_OTHER clock is exported */
 #define CLK_PLL_PERIPH_BASE	14
 #define CLK_PLL_PERIPH		15
 #define CLK_PLL_PERIPH_SATA	16
diff --git a/include/dt-bindings/clock/sun4i-a10-ccu.h b/include/dt-bindings/clock/sun4i-a10-ccu.h
index e4fa61be5..dbf4b164a 100644
--- a/include/dt-bindings/clock/sun4i-a10-ccu.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/clock/sun4i-a10-ccu.h
@@ -44,6 +44,7 @@
 
 #define CLK_HOSC		1
 #define CLK_PLL_VIDEO0_2X	9
+#define CLK_PLL_DDR_OTHER	13
 #define CLK_PLL_VIDEO1_2X	18
 #define CLK_CPU			20
 
